      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.4.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<ul><li>Claude Profiles is now SupaConductor. The menu bar shows SC.</li><li>Usage readings show their age: after 30 minutes the bar fades and says when it was read, after 6 hours it turns hollow.</li><li>Weekly reset times appear only when Claude Code reported them or your history confirms them, so they no longer show the wrong day.</li></ul>]]></description>
